<title>USA: USA-STOCKS-OPEN.</title>
<headline>USA-STOCKS-OPEN.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wall Street stocks moved higher in early trading on Wednesday, following through on the previous day's rally despite a sell-off in shares of IBM after three brokerages shaved their 1997 EPS views for the company.</p>
<p>The  Dow Industrials were up three at 6861 and the Nasdaq Composite was up six at 1337. 1720</p>
